      Part4: 2109620131
    tag: 
  allNodes:
  - dialogueText: '*mumbling* Don''t interrupt me, please.'
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 6774952781063389271
    isRootNode: 1
    editorPosition: {x: 36, y: 200}
    altDialoguePaths:
    - rid: 3046478928603512907
    guid:
      Part1: 2057167422
      Part2: 1202360108
      Part3: 3930196662
      Part4: 2673321245
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: '*mumbling* ...what? No, wait!

      Sorry, you aren''t really
      interrupting anything... though I wish you <b>were</b>.

      I''m supposed
      to be working but I just... can''t seem to concentrate right now!

      I''m
      perpetually surrounded by distractions!'
    characterEmotion: 5
    characterReaction: 7
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 6774952781063389273
    - rid: 6774952781063389274
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 749, y: 200}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 1360821110
      Part2: 1150351294
      Part3: 394618025
      Part4: 843417109
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Why, my magnum opus, of course!

      I came to this hotel in
      the middle of nowhere because I thought it would finally allow me to focus.

      Art
      isn''t done in between parties and drugs,...or so my acquaintances insisted
      before dragging me here with their <b>constant</b> negging...'
    characterEmotion: 4
    characterReaction: 2
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 6774952781063389276
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 1603, y: 200}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 1912412569
      Part2: 1176304640
      Part3: 4006625692
      Part4: 3404152489
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Honestly, I don''t know why anyone would ever want to come here!

      There''s
      absolutely nothing to be found in the barren wasteland.

      Come to think
      of it, what are <b>you</b> doing here?'
    characterEmotion: 2
    characterReaction: 2
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 6774952781063389282
    - rid: 6774952781063389283
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 2719.0005, y: 132.15001}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 3892543937
      Part2: 1269768710
      Part3: 72402331
      Part4: 3495413746
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: Oh, fun! I've always admired an inquisitive man.
    characterEmotion: 4
    characterReaction: 7
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 767062219271962627
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 3513.0005, y: 10.550037}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 2962323646
      Part2: 1219424991
      Part3: 2208296589
      Part4: 221618474
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Well now that you mention it...

      I haven''t noticed anything!

      But
      I do have the feeling that someone is following me, probably one of my crazy
      fans.'
    characterEmotion: 1
    characterReaction: 2
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 767062219271962629
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 4292, y: 25}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 225817479
      Part2: 1313308961
      Part3: 3434165929
      Part4: 2998891506
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Honey, I <b>always</b> know.

      Everyone seems to think they
      go by unnoticed, but I can just <b>feel</b> them staring, thinking "Wow, that
      guy seems so cool, he''s probably thinking about very important stuff".

      And
      they''d be right about both of those things. Such is the curse of the artist,
      I''m afraid...'
    characterEmotion: 4
    characterReaction: 2
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478928603512908
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 5190, y: 25}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 2383782272
      Part2: 1171092457
      Part3: 1239954319
      Part4: 1715619021
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: Sure, sure... It's all right darling, we all have secrets.
    characterEmotion: 4
    characterReaction: 7
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 767062219271962626
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 3526.0005, y: 200.00003}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 2905626123
      Part2: 1321977202
      Part3: 1668191632
      Part4: 2258590115
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: "Oh yeah, I can't catch a break from all the fame...\nIt's hard,
      you know? Everyone wanting to look at you, take pictures of you, interview
      you...It's always about me- I mean you. \nHonestly, honey? Sometimes, I don't
      even know how I do it. Anyone less than me would probably crumble to such pressure
      in an instant."
    characterEmotion: 4
    characterReaction: 2
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 6774952781063389279
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 1603.0002, y: 524.1501}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 2940989589
      Part2: 1329345381
      Part3: 3524439476
      Part4: 2608150884
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'What''s worse is, I cannot, for the life of me, get rid of the
      paparazzis! Not even here!

      I just <b>heard</b> that damn camera shutter.
      If I ever find them, I have a word or two to say to whoever is taking pictures!
      At my! Spiritual! Retreat!'
    characterEmotion: 5
    characterReaction: 2
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 6774952781063389281
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 2841.5508, y: 431.00006}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 3811894892
      Part2: 1232020286
      Part3: 1280881046
      Part4: 1510069764
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'I wish that was the case... but where could I possibly go? The
      sauna won''t open, the kitchen is locked as well, and I''m absolutely NOT going
      in my bedroom, what with all that <b>chaos</b> going on upstairs.

      All
      that is left is this table, unless you can think of something better. '
    characterEmotion: 2
    characterReaction: 2
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046479050573086722
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 2901.85, y: 492.00003}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 4011333442
      Part2: 1206951856
      Part3: 2580763575
      Part4: 3572550708
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Well, either there''s a '
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses: []
    isRootNode: 0
