      Part2: 1275199733
      Part3: 2353852820
      Part4: 4211439072
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: "Worse. I <b>heard</b> them.  That damn camera shutter... a sound
      I will always recognize. \nUnbelievable! I cannot, for the life of me, get
      rid of the paparazzis! Not even here!\nIf I ever find them, I have a word or
      two to say to whoever is taking pictures! At my! Spiritual! Retreat!"
    characterEmotion: 5
    characterReaction: 2
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 6774952781063389281
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 2933, y: 792}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 1866444140
      Part2: 1318639581
      Part3: 3008323730
      Part4: 425362122
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'I wish that was the case... but where could I possibly go? The
      sauna won''t open, the kitchen is locked as well, and I''m absolutely NOT going
      in my bedroom, what with all that <b>chaos</b> going on upstairs.

      All
      that is left is this table, unless you can think of something better. '
    characterEmotion: 5
    characterReaction: 2
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046479050573086722
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 2901.85, y: 492.00003}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 3403335406
      Part2: 1326432269
      Part3: 3950741638
      Part4: 921685745
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Hah! Well, either there''s an invisible construction site next
      to this hotel, or someone near the suite <b>no. 1</b> has a really LOUD hobby.

      When
      I came to a place as desolated as this one, it''s because I was expecting to
      be away from the sounds of the city.

      But no: hammer strikes, drill roars,
      any industrial sound imaginable seems to follow me... and to think the host
      told me this was "her best room"...'
    characterEmotion: 2
    characterReaction: 2
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046479065253412983
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 4517.05, y: 492.00006}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 931422527
      Part2: 1218130906
      Part3: 1804454273
      Part4: 2257800816
